  "description": "Ledger health (design doc \u00a712). Traces are in Explore \u2192 Tempo; alerts are evaluated by Prometheus (localhost:9090/alerts).",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Traces (Tempo)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22%7D",
